    <briefdescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="class_mutable_engine_object" kindref="compound">MutableEngineObject</ref></computeroutput> wrapper that owns an <computeroutput><ref refid="class_s_l_program" kindref="compound">SLProgram</ref></computeroutput> via <computeroutput>unique_ptr</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Exposes the unwrapped DAG through <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m2_s_l_program_a1005118ac05ff326296ea86f3994d46c_1a1005118ac05ff326296ea86f3994d46c" kindref="member">value()</ref></computeroutput> so engine code that holds an <computeroutput>M2SLProgram*</computeroutput> can reach the actual program without leaking its concrete type to interpreter callers. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
